{"seq":1,"slug":"structured-concurrency","title":"结构化并发与 errgroup","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/go-concurrency-runtime-patterns/practice/structured-concurrency","wordCount":551,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"结构化并发与-errgroup\">结构化并发与 errgroup</h1><p>「结构化并发」（Structured Concurrency）是 2020 年代并发编程的核心范式转移——它要求每个 goroutine 都有明确的所有者和生命周期边界：父作用域结束时，所有子 goroutine 必须已经终止。Go 标准库的 <code>golang.org/x/sync/errgroup</code> 是实现这一理念的主力工具：它将 WaitGroup + Context + 错误传播 封装为一个统一的原语。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>结构化并发的核心约束：<strong>子 goroutine 的生命周期不超过父作用域</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>非结构化（raw goroutine）</th>\n<th>结构化（errgroup）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>启动</td>\n<td><code>go func()</code></td>\n<td><code>g.Go(func() error)</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>等待</td>\n<td>手动 WaitGroup</td>\n<td><code>g.Wait()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>取消</td>\n<td>手动 context 传播</td>\n<td>首错自动取消所有兄弟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误收集</td>\n<td>手动 channel/slice</td>\n<td><code>Wait()</code> 返回首错</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>泄漏风险</td>\n<td>高（忘记 Wait/忘记取消）</td>\n<td>低（结构保证）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    PARENT[&quot;父作用域&quot;] --&gt; G[&quot;errgroup.WithContext&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; T1[&quot;g.Go: Task 1&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; T2[&quot;g.Go: Task 2&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; T3[&quot;g.Go: Task 3&quot;]&#10;    T2 --&gt;|&quot;返回 error&quot;| CANCEL[&quot;ctx 自动取消&quot;]&#10;    CANCEL -.-&gt;|&quot;ctx.Done()&quot;| T1&#10;    CANCEL -.-&gt;|&quot;ctx.Done()&quot;| T3&#10;    T1 --&gt;|&quot;感知取消,退出&quot;| WAIT[&quot;g.Wait()&quot;]&#10;    T3 --&gt;|&quot;感知取消,退出&quot;| WAIT&#10;    WAIT --&gt; PARENT\">graph TD\n    PARENT[\"父作用域\"] --&gt; G[\"errgroup.WithContext\"]\n    G --&gt; T1[\"g.Go: Task 1\"]\n    G --&gt; T2[\"g.Go: Task 2\"]\n    G --&gt; T3[\"g.Go: Task 3\"]\n    T2 --&gt;|\"返回 error\"| CANCEL[\"ctx 自动取消\"]\n    CANCEL -.-&gt;|\"ctx.Done()\"| T1\n    CANCEL -.-&gt;|\"ctx.Done()\"| T3\n    T1 --&gt;|\"感知取消,退出\"| WAIT[\"g.Wait()\"]\n    T3 --&gt;|\"感知取消,退出\"| WAIT\n    WAIT --&gt; PARENT</pre><h2 id=\"errgroup-标准用法\">errgroup 标准用法</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"func fetchAll(ctx context.Context, urls []string) ([]Response, error) {&#10;    g, ctx := errgroup.WithContext(ctx)&#10;    results := make([]Response, len(urls))&#10;&#10;    for i, url := range urls {&#10;        i, url := i, url // Go 1.22+ 不需要这行&#10;        g.Go(func() error {&#10;            resp, err := httpGet(ctx, url)&#10;            if err != nil {&#10;                return fmt.Errorf(&quot;fetch %s: %w&quot;, url, err)&#10;            }&#10;            results[i] = resp&#10;            return nil&#10;        })&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    if err := g.Wait(); err != nil {&#10;        return nil, err // 返回第一个错误&#10;    }&#10;    return results, nil&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchAll</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">urls</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) ([]</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    g, ctx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> errgroup.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WithContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    results </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> make</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([]</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Response</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(urls))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i, url </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> urls {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        i, url </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i, url </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Go 1.22+ 不需要这行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        g.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Go</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            resp, err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> httpGet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, url)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> fmt.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Errorf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fetch </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%s</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">%w</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, url, err)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            results[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> resp</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> g.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Wait</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, err </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 返回第一个错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> results, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键行为：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>errgroup.WithContext</code> 返回一个派生 context，首个 goroutine 返回 error 时自动 cancel</li>\n<li>其余 goroutine 通过 <code>ctx.Done()</code> 感知取消并退出</li>\n<li><code>Wait()</code> 阻塞直到所有 goroutine 退出，返回第一个非 nil error</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"并发度限制-setlimit\">并发度限制：SetLimit</h2><p>errgroup 自 Go 1.20 起支持限制并发 goroutine 数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"g, ctx := errgroup.WithContext(ctx)&#10;g.SetLimit(10) // 最多 10 个 goroutine 同时运行&#10;&#10;for _, task := range tasks {&#10;    t := task&#10;    g.Go(func() error { // 超过 limit 时 Go() 阻塞&#10;        return process(ctx, t)&#10;    })&#10;}&#10;return g.Wait()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">g, ctx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> errgroup.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WithContext</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">g.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">SetLimit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 最多 10 个 goroutine 同时运行</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> _, task </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> range</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tasks {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> task</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    g.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Go</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 超过 limit 时 Go() 阻塞</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, t)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    })</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> g.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Wait</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对比手动 semaphore 方案：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>errgroup.SetLimit</th>\n<th>手动 sem + WaitGroup</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>代码量</td>\n<td>1 行设置</td>\n<td>~15 行样板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首错取消</td>\n<td>自动</td>\n<td>需手动传播</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>背压位置</td>\n<td>Go() 调用处阻塞</td>\n<td>sem &lt;- 处阻塞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可读性</td>\n<td>声明式</td>\n<td>命令式</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"errgroup-vs-waitgroup-选择\">errgroup vs WaitGroup 选择</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 用 WaitGroup 的场景：&#10;// - 不需要错误收集（fire-and-forget）&#10;// - 不需要首错取消&#10;// - goroutine 不返回 error&#10;&#10;// 用 errgroup 的场景：&#10;// - 任何 goroutine 失败应取消其它&#10;// - 需要收集错误&#10;// - 需要并发度限制&#10;// - 几乎所有生产代码\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 用 WaitGroup 的场景：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// - 不需要错误收集（fire-and-forget）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// - 不需要首错取消</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// - goroutine 不返回 error</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 用 errgroup 的场景：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// - 任何 goroutine 失败应取消其它</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// - 需要收集错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// - 需要并发度限制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// - 几乎所有生产代码</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"context-传播深度\">Context 传播深度</h2><p>结构化并发的效力取决于 context 被传播的深度。浅传播（只传到第一层）会导致深层 I/O 不感知取消：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// 错误：context 只到第一层&#10;g.Go(func() error {&#10;    data := fetchFromDB(query) // 不接受 ctx！&#10;    return transform(data)&#10;})&#10;&#10;// 正确：context 贯穿到每个 I/O 调用&#10;g.Go(func() error {&#10;    data, err := fetchFromDB(ctx, query) // ctx 传递&#10;    if err != nil {&#10;        return err&#10;    }&#10;    return transform(ctx, data) // ctx 传递&#10;})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 错误：context 只到第一层</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">g.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Go</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchFromDB</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(query) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 不接受 ctx！</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(data)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 正确：context 贯穿到每个 I/O 调用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">g.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Go</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    data, err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fetchFromDB</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, query) </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ctx 传递</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC